The Zero 28's case LED off during U-Boot's boot picture: the same line in U-Boot's copy of
the h028b23 panel driver (see 071).
--- a/lichee/brandy-2.0/u-boot-2018/drivers/video/sunxi/disp2/disp/lcd/h028b23.c
+++ b/lichee/brandy-2.0/u-boot-2018/drivers/video/sunxi/disp2/disp/lcd/h028b23.c
@@ -117,7 +117,7 @@
 	sunxi_lcd_delay_ms(100);
 	panel_reset(sel, 1);
 	sunxi_lcd_delay_ms(100);
-	LED_SET(sel, 0);
+	LED_SET(sel, 1);	/* oakMOSS: the case LED's blue half stays off */
 }
 
 static void lcd_power_off(u32 sel)
